   "blogPosts":[
      {
         "tag":"",
         "slug":"together-sports-joins-align-gsoc",
         "image":"https://substackcdn.com/image/fetch/$s_!TSyi!,f_auto,q_auto:good,fl_progressive:steep/https%3A%2F%2Fsubstack-post-media.s3.amazonaws.com%2Fpublic%2Fimages%2Fd4ad1407-75ea-484b-b692-a037d7a18ed7_646x610.png",
         "title":"Together Sports Joins ALIGN GSOC: Building Global Impact Through Collaboration ",
         "author":"Together Sports",
         "excerpt":"At Together Sports, our mission has always been simple: expand access to sports for those who need it most.",
         "featured":false,
         "sourceUrl":"https://togethersports.substack.com/p/together-sports-joins-align-gsoc",
         "contentHtml":"<p>At Together Sports, our mission has always been simple: expand access to sports for those who need it most. What started as a local initiative has grown into something much bigger: a movement focused on inclusion, opportunity, and community.</p><p><strong>That&#8217;s why we&#8217;re excited to share that Together Sports is now part of <a href=\"https://www.instagram.com/align.gsoc/\">ALIGN GSOC</a> (Global Student Organizations Conference).</strong></p><p>ALIGN GSOC brings together student-led organizations from around the world to collaborate, scale impact, and build meaningful partnerships. It&#8217;s not just about sharing ideas &#8212; it&#8217;s about turning those ideas into real, measurable change.</p><p>For Together Sports, this is a natural next step.</p><p>We&#8217;ve seen firsthand how powerful sports can be in underserved communities &#8212; building confidence, fostering connection, and creating opportunities where there were none. But the challenges we&#8217;re tackling aren&#8217;t limited to one city or one country. They&#8217;re global.</p><p>Through ALIGN GSOC, we&#8217;ll be able to:</p><ul><li><p>Connect with other student leaders working on real-world problems</p></li><li><p>Share our model for expanding access to sports</p></li><li><p>Learn from organizations across education, STEM, health, and social impact</p></li><li><p>Build partnerships that help us scale Together Sports beyond our current reach</p></li></ul><p>This opportunity comes at a key moment for us. As we expand into new locations and explore new sports, collaboration becomes essential. Being part of a global network allows us to grow smarter, faster, and with greater impact.</p><p>Most importantly, it reinforces something we&#8217;ve believed from the start:</p><p>Real change happens when people build together.</p><p>We&#8217;re proud to be part of ALIGN GSOC and excited for what&#8217;s ahead.</p><div class=\"captioned-image-container\"><figure><a class=\"image-link image2 is-viewable-img\" target=\"_blank\" href=\"https://substackcdn.com/image/fetch/$s_!TSyi!,f_auto,q_auto:good,fl_progressive:steep/https%3A%2F%2Fsubstack-post-media.s3.amazonaws.com%2Fpublic%2Fimages%2Fd4ad1407-75ea-484b-b692-a037d7a18ed7_646x610.png\" data-component-name=\"Image2ToDOM\"><div class=\"image2-inset\"><picture><source type=\"image/webp\" srcset=\"https://substackcdn.com/image/fetch/$s_!TSyi!,w_424,c_limit,f_webp,q_auto:good,fl_progressive:steep/https%3A%2F%2Fsubstack-post-media.s3.amazonaws.com%2Fpublic%2Fimages%2Fd4ad1407-75ea-484b-b692-a037d7a18ed7_646x610.png 424w, https://substackcdn.com/image/fetch/$s_!TSyi!,w_848,c_limit,f_webp,q_auto:good,fl_progressive:steep/https%3A%2F%2Fsubstack-post-media.s3.amazonaws.com%2Fpublic%2Fimages%2Fd4ad1407-75ea-484b-b692-a037d7a18ed7_646x610.png 848w, https://substackcdn.com/image/fetch/$s_!TSyi!,w_1272,c_limit,f_webp,q_auto:good,fl_progressive:steep/https%3A%2F%2Fsubstack-post-media.s3.amazonaws.com%2Fpublic%2Fimages%2Fd4ad1407-75ea-484b-b692-a037d7a18ed7_646x610.png 1272w, https://substackcdn.com/image/fetch/$s_!TSyi!,w_1456,c_limit,f_webp,q_auto:good,fl_progressive:steep/https%3A%2F%2Fsubstack-post-media.s3.amazonaws.com%2Fpublic%2Fimages%2Fd4ad1407-75ea-484b-b692-a037d7a18ed7_646x610.png 1456w\" sizes=\"100vw\"><img src=\"https://substackcdn.com/image/fetch/$s_!TSyi!,w_1456,c_limit,f_auto,q_auto:good,fl_progressive:steep/https%3A%2F%2Fsubstack-post-media.s3.amazonaws.com%2Fpublic%2Fimages%2Fd4ad1407-75ea-484b-b692-a037d7a18ed7_646x610.png\" width=\"284\" height=\"268.1733746130031\" data-attrs=\"{\"src\":\"https://substack-post-media.s3.amazonaws.com/public/images/d4ad1407-75ea-484b-b692-a037d7a18ed7_646x610.png\",\"srcNoWatermark\":null,\"fullscreen\":null,\"imageSize\":null,\"height\":610,\"width\":646,\"resizeWidth\":284,\"bytes\":151725,\"alt\":null,\"title\":null,\"type\":\"image/png\",\"href\":null,\"belowTheFold\":true,\"topImage\":false,\"internalRedirect\":\"https://togethersports.