   "experiences":[
      {
         "id":"quote-1",
         "age":"Parent",
         "name":"Leigh H",
         "type":"parent",
         "image":"",
         "quote":"My 4-year-old had her first tennis lesson with Coach Harry, and it could not have gone better. He met her where she was, encouraging, kind, and full of energy. Together Tennis makes tennis feel welcoming for families at every level.",
         "sport":"Tennis"
      },
      {
         "id":"quote-2",
         "age":"Parent",
         "name":"Michael B",
         "type":"parent",
         "image":"",
         "quote":"Zoe had a great experience practicing tennis with Harry. He did an excellent job teaching her techniques to improve her game. I would highly recommend Harry to any students who are looking to become better tennis players.",
         "sport":"Tennis"
      },
      {
         "id":"quote-3",
         "age":"Parent",
         "name":"Rachel L",
         "type":"parent",
         "image":"",
         "quote":"Theo has always been quite shy, especially in new environments where he would normally stay close to me. Seeing him open up with you has been truly special, thank you for helping him come out of his shell!",
         "sport":"Tennis"
      },
      {
         "id":"photo-1",
         "type":"photo",
         "image":"media:img-0903",
         "caption":"Hailey and Alex were a blast to coach.  Just one of those really fun sessions."
      },
      {
         "id":"photo-2",
         "type":"photo",
         "image":"media:img-3782",
         "caption":"Such a fun session with Kiersten. She kept getting better and better the whole time."
      },
      {
         "id":"photo-4",
         "type":"photo",
         "image":"media:hero-sports",
         "caption":"Theo tried it for the first time today and was into it right away."
      },
      {
         "id":"quote-1777518853471-o7hd09",
         "age":"Parent",
         "name":"Daniel B",
         "type":"parent",
         "image":"",
         "quote":"We had a great session with Harry, Sheldon, and Jonah. They made my 6-year-old daughter feel completely at ease right away, which isn’t always easy. They kept things fun while still teaching real skills, and she stayed engaged the whole time. It was a really positive experience for both of us.",
         "sport":"Tennis"
      },
      {
         "id":"parent-1777518903586-sijwse",
         "age":"Parent",
         "name":"James S",
         "type":"parent",
         "image":"",
         "quote":"Tiam has been an incredible coach. He’s patient, encouraging, and knows exactly how to connect while still pushing for improvement. Every lesson feels structured and productive, but also enjoyable. We’ve seen real progress and wouldn’t want to work with anyone else.\n\n",
         "sport":"Basketball"
      },
      {
         "id":"quote-1777519082185-kf07k3",
         "age":"Parent",
         "name":"Marcus D",
         "type":"parent",
         "image":"",
         "quote":"From the first session, Charlie just got it. He meets kids where they are and builds them up step by step. My son used to be hesitant, and now he’s confident, focused, and actually excited to practice on his own. That shift has been huge for us.",
         "sport":"Football"
      },
      {
         "id":"parent-1777519083115-qpuok1",
         "age":"Parent",
         "name":"Daniela R",
         "type":"parent",
         "image":"",
         "quote":"What really stands out about Gabriel and Zachary is how organized and intentional they are. Every session has a purpose, but it never feels forced. They keep it positive and motivating. You can see the improvement week to week, and the kids genuinely enjoy being there",
         "sport":"Soccer"
      },
      {
         "id":"parent-1777519083385-n8ev44",
         "age":"Parent",
         "name":"Louis M",
         "type":"parent",
         "image":"",
         "quote":"Solomon has a calm, patient way of teaching that makes a big difference. He breaks things down simply and never rushes, which helped my child stay confident instead of frustrated. It’s been great watching their skills and love for such a hard sport grow.",
         "sport":"Golf"
      },
      {
         "id":"photo-1777519361242-msi4ak",
         "type":"photo",
         "image":"https://mifoypysqezmialwxgxd.supabase.co/storage/v1/object/public/site-media/admin/1777519395791-img-2579.webp",
         "caption":"Ella brought great excitement and focus today. Really proud of her progress!"
      },
